                                                               ; the templating side; aes/decrypt128 writes its ten
                                                               ; schedule temps with the downward turn and reads them
                                                               ; back with this one  because the inverse cipher
                                                               ; consumes them in the opposite order from the one that
                                                               ; made them; every byte moves up four places  the
                                                               ; highest four into the scratch above
